{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:682","content":{"id":682,"title":"两数之和","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b1c428f7-beef-443f-82b0-92b45b34e16b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"LeetCode：两数之和。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"a543c738-3453-488a-af88-2d8ee810516e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"935b40a5-2698-438e-be92-897d33dd3d08","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给定一个整数数组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和一个目标值 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"target"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，请你在该数组中找出和为目标值的那两个整数，并返回他们的数组下标。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6bb191a7-eda8-4d42-8cd1-ac9c3469f2bc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"你可以假设每种输入只会对应一个答案，但是，数组中同一个元素不能使用两遍。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cf9889b5-5e2e-4cb7-8daa-ee70dda03736","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"你可以按任意顺序返回答案。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1c82bf78-8f0d-4599-8a3f-91810969d7ac","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例1："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"Java","uuid":"612ce24b-5941-4f3f-bf20-95708baa37f2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"14dd8007-f96a-4edd-b4d4-e699a4fd2a7b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：nums = [2,7,11,15], target = 9\n输出：[0,1]\n解释：因为 nums[0] + nums[1] == 9 ，返回 [0, 1]","collabId":"7ffc91bb-14c9-4b9b-aea6-173a5f6af59b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b7571023-c271-4bd2-89e4-452b29dc096f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例2:"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"d05f985b-fb9e-4567-829b-2bdf6c2091d1","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b9ff542d-6ba0-4b0c-b94e-36bd12f655d1","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"输入：nums = [3,2,4], target = 6\n输出：[1,2]","collabId":"713ce4a6-8c87-45fd-a310-a6eef807332d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"32b0cfeb-2d35-45f3-8de9-2a158dbc226a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"62f9f45a-aac1-4b9a-8c8f-7f46b720f346","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解决该方法最容易的版本是，首先固定一个数 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums[i]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，然后遍历数组查看是否包含 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"target-nums[i]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的数字，代码如下："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"5b4b29c3-dc3b-4aa0-b277-475a8f52b8e0","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e8f5d3c4-9787-4eff-8cff-40c6c985c3ff","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public int[] twoSum(int[] nums, int target) {\n    int[] res = new int[2];\n    // 首先固定 nums[i]\n    for (int i = 0; i < nums.length - 1; i++) {\n        // 接着在剩下的数字查找是否有数字等于 target - nums[j] \n        // 或者说 nums[i] + nums[j] = target\n        for (int j = i + 1; j < nums.length; j++) {\n            if (nums[i] + nums[j] == target) {\n                res[0] = i;\n                res[1] = j;\n                return res;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    return res;\n}","collabId":"f60aa057-16f6-4ecf-be72-9b87f9e0ab95","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e446fa24-6672-4cf3-9664-144abc5a7281","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用这种双重循环的方法，它的时间复杂度是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"O(n^2)","collabId":"f586342f-3813-4d82-bbb1-4fe611881e77","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"O(n^2)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d0695858-59a0-4279-942b-73072e62e125","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那有没有只需要扫描一遍数组即可以确定答案的办法，答案是有，我们可以利用哈希表做这件事情。我们在遍历数组时，我们将数组中的数字以及对应的下标以键值对的形式添加到一个哈希表中，每次我们在遍历一个数字 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums[i]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，在添加该数字到哈希表之前(之所以是之前，以防一个数字被用两次，可以自己举个例子想想)，都在哈希表中查看是否有数字为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"target - nums[i]"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因为向哈希表查询的时间复杂度为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"O(1)","collabId":"5d79088f-cdd2-430f-bee7-bd6453f246f2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"O(1)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以这种只用遍历一遍数组即可知道解的方法，它的时间复杂度为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"O(n)","collabId":"c7dc18bc-e279-4469-9f61-d8984b715a64","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"O(n)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，代码如下："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"2833aa82-bf34-487b-9930-fccef622c8a2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6322695f-f779-44c2-a0b1-e8b326588546","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public int[] twoSum(int[] nums, int target) {\n    int[] res = new int[2];\n    HashMap<Integer, Integer> map = new HashMap<>();\n    for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {\n        // 首先进行查询，查询完了在将 nums[i] 添加到哈希表中\n        if (map.containsKey(target - nums[i])) {\n            res[0] = map.get(target - nums[i]);\n            res[1] = i;\n            break;\n        }\n        map.put(nums[i], i);\n    }\n    return res;\n}","collabId":"6813b0c2-be5e-4cc1-9063-7691f5e8f38a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"90a0046f-58fc-4651-ad54-86d66de824e8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"扩展：有序数组"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8854504d-1794-422f-a040-b024467262bb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在我们对上面的题目加个条件，给定的数组是有序的，且是从小到大排序的，那么有没有更快的方法来找到答案。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7a807423-d37b-48c9-871f-b13185e87447","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果数组是有序的话，那么我们可以使用双指针的解法，首先一个指针指向数组的开头，即最小的那个数字，另一个指针指向数组的末尾，即最大的那个数字。接着我们通过移动这两个指针来找到答案"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"f983de63-30ca-4553-8522-13bd985505f1","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a94c600c-e9a8-4c8c-a9cf-f3184b4c93ff","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7c98d1bd-33b2-43ea-bbaa-f75d46ffe570","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果这两个指针指向的数字之和大于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"target"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么我们要将指向末尾的指针向前移，因为第一个指针指向的数是最小的数，所以这时任何数加上后一个指针指向的数都会比 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"target"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 大，所以该数不可能是解，排除"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"62f35a3d-dbf5-4015-8558-ce5b1c9863f9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ba4c47e4-91d6-4a14-b2ff-c1b9b86a3382","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果小于，那么指向开头的指针向前移，道理同上，因为这时任何一个数和第一个指针指向的数相加都小于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"target"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以该指针指向的数不可能是解，排除"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"acbbb95d-a628-432e-aa8f-4fe9470f0419","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1115e01a-d69d-425d-bcce-7c30e951e05d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果等于，那就是找到了"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"44e276c5-f431-4a12-8aff-7651607902e1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以下图为例："}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4be69f06-9289-42a9-8a23-bd7aa91ac46b.webp","uuid":"9c93a9cc-18a4-4c02-99a4-5b06b021af7b","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_4be69f06-9289-42a9-8a23-bd7aa91ac46b.webp","width":559.1666444473806,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"1364d6d9-3d45-4d51-aaaa-6f70a5241e73","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"30ba4c27-6c7f-4941-a657-c33066e06bbe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"代码如下："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"java","uuid":"ff2a6600-cb76-4c48-aa0c-dc2945cdb6ea","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"eeb627d2-7539-4838-90a0-cc6a19eed680","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"public int[] twoSum(int[] nums, int target) {\n    int p1 = 0;\n    int p2 = nums.length - 1;\n    int[] res = new int[2];\n    while (p1 < p2) {\n        if (nums[p1] + nums[p2] == targets) {\n            res[0] = p1;\n            res[1] = p2;\n            break;\n        }\n        if (nums[p1] + nums[p2] < target) {\n            p1++;\n        } else {\n            p2--;\n        }\n    }\n    return res;\n}","collabId":"74a5fa9f-f8be-415c-a255-10f2c6736821","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"0b17366f-3ff3-4d87-8f38-cc0f40778a75","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"3270bc4b-64db-4c1a-9df6-83ac5e28d0bd","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"10604e81-5342-48f3-9c0b-fa65303ac758","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"140b8e90-6f8c-4aef-9644-9bcfa157645a","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/two-sum/","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"0f7a8f33-e5e9-415e-9c07-162d0586b787","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"两数之和"}]}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"双指针"},{"label":"两数之和","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:682","type":"doc","id":682}}],"prevPage":{"title":"Pow(x, n)","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:679","type":"doc","id":679}},"nextPage":{"title":"三数之和","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:683","type":"doc","id":683}},"createTime":1728990519155,"updateTime":1775928959914,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1775928959914}}